// @input: entry <<'EOF'

---

## Entry 16 — Readiness action items and the price table

**Request (verbatim):** "lets proceed with the action iteams and commit the config/prices/2026-10-22.toml"

**Price table (B-011):** the owner had filled `config/prices/2026-10-22.toml` (four models, standard API rates per million tokens, source URL, `verified = true`, read 2026-10-22). Committed as `9a3e0cb` on `docs/prd-v0.4-attach` (PR #2) with B-011 marked done. Values are the owner's; not re-derived.

**Action items** on `chore/readiness-actions` (stacked on PR #2), PR [#3](https://github.com/dctellya/droid-observatory/pull/3):

- **B-013 code scanning.** `PATCH /repos/.../code-scanning/default-setup state=configured` accepted; state now `configured`, languages detected `actions` (Rust is added by GitHub once code exists). `gate.yml`: Semgrep writes SARIF, uploaded by a new `sast-upload` job (the codeql action needs the runner's Node, absent in the semgrep container); Trivy SARIF uploaded in `fs-scan`. `security-events: write` only on those two jobs. `github/codeql-action/upload-sarif` pinned to `9b32540` (v4.39.1, tag dereferenced to commit). Commit `e752810`.
- **B-004 release.** `bundle.yml` extracted from the gate as a reusable workflow (gate job keeps the name `bundle`, ruleset untouched). `release.yml` on `v*`: verifies the tag is on `main` and semver, builds the bundle if the Tauri config exists, `gh release create --generate-notes`. `.github/release.yml` groups notes by our labels. `actions/download-artifact` pinned to `9000827` (v8.0.2). Decision D-009. New B-016 (Cargo version = tag, needs `Cargo.toml`). Commit `d4dab77`.
- **B-001 devcontainer.** Image `mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/rust:1-1-bookworm@sha256:fc57fb86…` (digest from MCR manifest on 2026-10-22). `post-create.sh` installs actionlint 1.7.12 (released 2026-03-30), lychee 0.24.2 (2026-05-01), gitleaks 8.30.1 (2026-03-21), cargo-deny 0.20.2 (2026-07-09), markdownlint-cli2 0.24.0, plus the Debian Tauri 2 libraries; asset names checked against each release. Renovate regex manager added for the `_VERSION=` lines; `renovate-config-validator` (renovate@44) validates; the cached renovate 37 rejected `managerFilePatterns`, which is expected for that version. Container not built here (no Docker in this session). Commit `c62d113`.
- **B-012 runbooks.** `docs/runbooks/`: README, red-gate, fix-cycle, stalled-mission, hooks-disabled, release. CLI steps now; app steps marked M1/M2/M3/M4. Commit `459de94`.
- README (gate section, layout), AGENTS.md (layout), BACKLOG (B-001, B-004, B-012, B-013 done with reasons; B-016 added).

**Not done:** B-005 coverage threshold (spec session). Readiness report not re-run; offered after merge.

**Checks:** `make check` green (markdownlint 0 issues; lychee 20 OK, 1 excluded; actionlint clean; gitleaks no leaks). Gate run on PR #3 pending at the time of writing; result recorded in the next entry if anything fails.
EOF
