 ["- **Mission metrics**: the lane-9 series, so the budget meter and waste can be charted and alerted on outside the desktop window. Metric names are a contract: `observatory.mission.cycle_seconds`, `observatory.feature.cycle_seconds`, `observatory.waste_seconds` (by role and cause), `observatory.rework_windows`, `observatory.fix_loops`, `observatory.tokens` (by role, model, class), `observatory.cost` (by unit and price table), `observatory.active_agents`.\n\nEndpoint and credentials come from `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` / `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS` or the OS keychain, never from the repository. Config keys and defaults: `config/observatory.example.toml` `[telemetry]`. CI telemetry is deferred (B-002).",
